        "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 08 2019 17:17:12 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h4>Ethics hotline</h4>\n<p>To report an ethics concern, contact our&nbsp;<b><a href=\"https://secure.ethicspoint.com/domain/media/en/gui/16493/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">ethics hotline</a></b>.<br>\n</p>\n",
