        "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 08 2019 17:17:12 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h4>Investors</h4>\n<p>If you have investor relations questions, please view our investor contacts&nbsp;or call the corporate office at +1 269 385 2600.<br>\n</p>\n",
