        "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 08 2019 17:17:12 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h4>Potential suppliers</h4>\n<p>If you are interested in supplying a product or service to us, please complete your supplier profile in our&nbsp;<a href=\"http://stryker.cvmsolutions.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Potential Supplier Registration Portal</b></a>.<br>\n</p>\n",
